    "summary": "Woman&#039;s wrapper; composed of sixteen narrow strips, hand sewn together. Indigo-dyed cotton warp and (hidden) red-dyed cotton weft. Pattern blocks in each strip: supplementary weft float motifs  including hands, animals, fish, and combs combined with supplementary weft bands in stripes of white, red-, indigo- and brown-dyed cotton. Single lines of soumak braiding in white cotton at both ends. Loose warp thread fringes at both ends.",
